  "title": "Intrepid Announces First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "Intrepid Potash, Inc. (\"Intrepid\", \"the Company\", \"we\", \"us\", or \"our\") (NYSE:IPI) today reported its results for the first quarter of 2026. First Quarter Highlights Management Commentary Supportive prices, resilient demand for potash and Trio ® , and continued improvement in Trio ® margins led to another quarter of strong financial results, highlighted by: Sales from continuing operations of $98.7 million; Net income from continuing operations of $6.9 million, or $0.52 per diluted share;",
